"{{Term/Store|EX Teleportation Rumors!||Series, BotW}}" is a [[Side Quest]] in {{BotW}}.<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|EX Teleportation Rumors!}}<br/>{{Color BotW|Side Quest|South Akkala Stable}}|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref> It is exclusive to {{TMT}} [[Downloadable Content]] Pack.

==Overview==
This [[Side Quest]] is obtained upon leaving the [[Great Plateau]] and loading the overworld of [[Hyrule Kingdom]], which can be done by [[Warping]], reloading a save file, dying, or leaving an [[Ancient Shrine]]. When the Quest is activated, [[Link]] will be tasked with finding a copy of the ''[[Super Rumor Mill EX]]'', which is located at the [[South Akkala Stable]].<ref>{{Cite|Apparently {{Color BotW|Red|South Akkala Stable}} has a copy of Super Rumor Mill EX, which details some rumors about this rare item...|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>{{Note|It is possible to activate the second stage of this Side Quest by reading the ''Super Rumor Mill V2'' without triggering any of the loading conditions for its activation.}}

The ''[[Super Rumor Mill V2]]'' is located on a table inside South Akkala Stable. In the book, [[Traysi]] discusses the dream of teleportation.<ref>{{Cite|Don't you make it a point to dig up rumors while traveling? In any case, today's topic of discussion is... {{Big|The Dream of Teleportation!}}|Super Rumor Mill V2|BotW}}</ref> She reports on a rumor that an ancient medallion, said to have the power to teleport its owner to wherever it was placed.<ref>{{Cite|Apparently, there was once an ancient medallion that could instantly teleport you to wherever you placed it...|Super Rumor Mill V2|BotW}}</ref> It is said be found in a [[Treasure Chest]] under a labyrinth in northeast [[Akkala]].<ref>{{Cite|I hear the treasure chest containing this tool is located beneath a labyrinth in northeast Akkala.|Super Rumor Mill V2|BotW}}</ref>

In the vast chamber beneath [[Lomei Labyrinth Island]], the Treasure Chest can be found on the southern wall. Upon opening the Treasure Chest, Link will obtain the [[Travel Medallion]] and complete the Side Quest.<ref>{{Cite|You managed to reach Lomei Labyrinth Island and found the {{Color BotW|Red|Travel Medallion}} in a secret underground room!|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>

